sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Edge (WAF/CDN/Waiting room)
    participant R as Reservation svc
    participant I as Idempotency (Redis)
    participant S as Inventory shard (Redis, Lua)
    participant P as PSP
    participant X as Reconciler
    participant O as Outbox -> Kafka -> Order writer -> Postgres

    C->>E: join queue
    E-->>C: admission token (HMAC, 15 min)
    C->>R: POST /skus/{sku}/holds + token + Idempotency-Key
    R->>I: SETNX key=pending
    R->>S: RESERVE (random shard, fall through on empty)
    S-->>R: hold_id (status=held, expires T+10m)
    R->>I: store 201 response
    R-->>C: 201 hold_id

    C->>R: POST /holds/{id}/pay + Idempotency-Key
    R->>S: BEGIN_PAYMENT held -> paying (removed from expiry sweep)
    R->>P: charge(idem = "charge:" + hold_id)
    alt charge ok
        P-->>R: charge_id
        R->>S: CONFIRM paying -> confirmed + XADD outbox (one atomic script)
        R-->>C: 200 confirmed
    else declined
        R->>S: ABORT paying -> held (user may retry before expiry)
        R-->>C: 402
    else breaker open / PSP limit (never sent)
        R->>S: ABORT paying -> held
        R-->>C: 503 + Retry-After (jittered)
    else timeout (outcome unknown)
        R-->>C: 202 payment_pending
        X->>P: lookup("charge:" + hold_id) after deadline
        alt found
            X->>S: CONFIRM (+ outbox)
        else not found
            X->>S: RELEASE paying -> released, stock + 1
        end
    end
    S-)O: outbox entry (at-least-once)
    O->>O: INSERT order ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING, then bucket sold < capacity
    Note over O: capacity violation => refund + page (last-line oversell guard)
